ina en consonante se usa la \"si\" . El hablante declara o comenta sobre algo que escapa  de su conocimiento personal y directo (inconsciente)."}]},{"word":"kanchis","morphemes":[{"text":"ka","type":"root","gloss":"s.","meaning":"Acto de dar o entregar algo a otra persona. . "},{"text":"-nchis","type":"suffix","gloss":"FLEXIVO DE NUMERO","meaning":"Sufijo de primera persona plural incluyente."}]},{"word":"huq","morphemes":[{"text":"huq","type":"root","gloss":"adj. / pron.","meaning":"Uno, un, otro (variante fonética Collao)."}]},{"word":"sunqulla.","morphemes":[{"text":"sunqu","type":"root","gloss":"s.","meaning":"Corazón"},{"text":"-lla","type":"suffix","gloss":"SUFIJO INDEPENDIENTE","meaning":"Corresponde a 'solamente’ o ‘únicamente’.Transmite afecto o es atenuador en las órdenes."}]},{"word":"Nuqayku","morphemes":[{"text":"nuqa","type":"root","gloss":"pron.","meaning":"Pronombre 1SG (yo). Variante regional Collao/Puno."},{"text":"-yku","type":"suffix","gloss":"FLEXIVO DE NUMERO","meaning":"Sufijo de primera persona plural excluyente."}]},{"word":"kayku","morphemes":[{"text":"ka","type":"root","gloss":"s.","meaning":"Acto de dar o entregar algo a otra persona. . "},{"text":"-yku","type":"suffix","gloss":"FLEXIVO DE NUMERO","meaning":"Sufijo de primera persona plural excluyente."}]},{"word":"qhichwa","morphemes":[{"text":"qhichwa","type":"root","gloss":"s. / adj.","meaning":"Quechua, lengua quechua, zona geográfica."}]},{"word":"runa.","morphemes":[{"text":"runa","type":"root","gloss":"s.","meaning":"Gente, hombre, persona humana"}]},{"word":"Qankuna","morphemes":[{"text":"qan","type":"root","gloss":"pron.","meaning":"Pronombre 2SG (tú)."},{"text":"-na","type":"suffix","gloss":"DERIVACIONAL DEVERBATIVO","meaning":"Convierte una raíz verbal en sustantivo. concretiza o sustantiviza a un verbo."}]},{"word":"ancha","morphemes":[{"text":"ancha","type":"root","gloss":"adv.","meaning":"Muy, bastante, sumamente."}]},{"word":"tusuy","morphemes":[{"text":"tusuy","type":"root